When summoning this card from your Removed Zone, you can discard up to three cards from your decktop. For each card discarded, this card's cost gets -1.

Flash- {{Accel|Cost 6 ()}}
Destroy all opposing Spirits/Ultimates with three cores or less on them. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.

After Errata = When your Life would be reduced by an opposing effect, by discarding this card from the Removed Zone, your Life is not reduced.

Flash - {{Accel|Cost 4 ()}}
During this turn, an opposing Spirit/Ultimate's symbol is fixed at zero. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.

When your Life would be reduced by an opposing effect, by discarding this card from your Removed Zone, your Life isn't decreased.

Flash- {{Accel|Cost 8 ()}}
During this turn, give all your Yellow Spirits an extra Yellow symbol. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up on the Removed Zone.

The symbol of this card on your Removed Zone is also treated as a symbol on the Field.

Main- {{Accel|Cost 3 ()}}
Draw two cards, then discard two cards from your Hand. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up on the Removed Zone.

The symbol of this card on your Removed Zone is also treated as a symbol on the field.

Flash- {{Accel|Cost 3 ()}}
Destroy an opposing Cost 4 or less Spirit. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up on the Removed Zone.

When your Life would be reduced by an opposing effect, by discarding this Spirit card from your Removed Zone, your Life won't be reduced.

Main- {{Accel|Cost 3 ()}}
You can reveal three cards from your decktop. Add every card with Accel among them to the Hand. Return any remaining cards to the deckbottom in any order. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.

{{sumcon|You control one or more Cost 1 or more Spirit}}

[LV3][LV4] {{ua|Red/Green/White}}
This Ultimate is unaffected by opposing Red/Green/White Spirit/Ultimate/Nexus/Magic effects.

uhand

{{Sumcon|You control one or more Cost 3 or higher Spirits}}

{{Burst|s|After your Life is reduced}}
During this turn, all opposing Spirits/Ultimates can't attack/block. After this effect resolves, summon this Ultimate card without paying the cost.

uhand

While this Spirit card is in your Removed Zone, no more than four cards can be discarded from either player's deck each turn due to "Deck Discarding effects".

 Flash- {{Accel|Cost 2()}}
During this turn, give all your "Galaxian"/"Astral Soul"/"God-King"/"Ten Crown" family Spirits +3000 BP. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.

{{Burst|s|After your Life is reduced}}
Reveal three cards from your decktop. Among them, you can summon all Cost 6 or less "Ten Crown" family Spirit cards, without paying the cost. Discard any unsummoned or remaining cards.
 During Seal For each Spirit summoned by this effect, put a core from the Void to any of your Spirits . After this effect resolves, summon this Spirit card without paying the cost.

When your Life would be reduced by an opposing effect, by discarding this Spirit card from your Removed Zone, your Life won't be reduced.

Main- {{Accel|Cost 1}}
Reveal two cards from your decktop. Return them to the decktop in any order. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.

This Brave doesn't exhaust and, while in Spirit form, can't attack nor block.

During Right Brave {{ua|Green/White/Yellow}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Green/White/Yellow Spirit/Ultimate/Nexus/Magic effects.

During Left Brave {{ua|Red/Purple/Blue}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Red/Purple/Blue Spirit/Ultimate/Nexus/Magic effects.

The symbol of this card in your Removed Zone is also treated as a symbol on the Field.

Flash- {{Accel|Cost 5 ()}}
Destroy up to three opposing Cost 3 or less Spirit/Ultimates. For each Spirit/Ultimate destroyed by this effect, discard three cards from the opposing decktop. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.
